{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100054","id":2217940138,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6EMxSq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100054","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100054.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100054.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100054","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100054/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100054/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100054/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0c2af944729e5505260a4e83eb6c528239d4ba8b","number":100054,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Optimize `String.simplify_path`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The new implementation is about 5.5x as fast. \r\nThis optimization is appropriate because `simplify_path` is called quite a lot, especially when starting the engine (~100 times when starting the launcher, another ~1000 times when opening a project). With `1000000` iterations from the benchmark taking 200ms, 1000 iterations were taking about 1ms (down to .2ms now). It's not much, but it's something!\r\n\r\n![newplot](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34129b9a-1f4b-49d8-bd32-4cf48c6d0243)\r\n\r\nThe new code is more opaque than the previous code. The reason is that most of the time was spent allocating new strings through the utility functions (`replace`, `delete_at` etc.). The fastest way to resolve the path is to resolve it manually.\r\n\r\nFortunately, it's not super hard to do it:\r\n\r\n- Handle drive part separately (verbatim, as before)\r\n- Run through each part ended by `'/'`, append to the string.\r\n- Ignore `/` at the start of path parts.\r\n- Ignore path parts that are equal to `.`.\r\n- Path parts that are equal to `..` are either resolved (by throwing away the latest path part), or prepended as a path part in a way that cannot be thrown away by subsequent `..`.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/g